Damn, that thing's gonna roast our ship to a crisp!

104
00:11:40,097 --> 00:11:43,097
Luffy, are you okay up there?

105
00:11:43,097 --> 00:11:48,097
It's super big, super strong, and it breathes fire.

106
00:11:48,097 --> 00:11:52,097
It's the coolest thing ever!

107
00:11:52,097 --> 00:11:55,097
Yeah, I get the feeling he's okay.

108
00:11:55,097 --> 00:11:59,097
I got a plan! I'm gonna make him join our crew!

109
00:11:59,097 --> 00:12:02,097
Wait, what?! Hang on, Luffy!

110
00:12:02,097 --> 00:12:05,097
All right, big guy, you're gonna join...

111
