Uh-oh!

152
00:13:44,097 --> 00:13:46,097
Ha-ha-ha-ha-ha-ha!

153
00:13:47,097 --> 00:13:49,097
Good luck getting away now, you giant beetle!

154
00:13:50,097 --> 00:13:52,097
So, you gonna join my crew or what?

155
00:13:52,097 --> 00:13:55,097
For what? I'd say yes if I were you.

156
