Stop fighting back, you pirate scum!

168
00:14:46,097 --> 00:14:52,097
If I'm not mistaken, you folks are from the Straw Hat Pirates, aren't you?

169
00:14:53,097 --> 00:14:55,097
Yeah, that's us!

170
00:14:56,097 --> 00:14:59,097
Oh man, you're right! I thought I recognized them!

171
00:15:00,097 --> 00:15:02,097
Yeah, that guy's Pirate Hunter Zoro!

172
00:15:02,097 --> 00:15:05,097
And him! That's the infamous black-legged Sanji!

173
00:15:06,097 --> 00:15:07,097
Uh, is that?

174
00:15:08,097 --> 00:15:09,097
Wait, who was that guy?

175
00:15:10,097 --> 00:15:11,097
Oh, come on!

176
00:15:11,097 --> 00:15:14,097
Let me go! That jerk tried to take Boss away from me!

177
00:15:15,097 --> 00:15:16,097
I'll bite him to death!

178
00:15:17,097 --> 00:15:18,097
